<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-bicyclus-anynana-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sekimura et al. (2015) Gierer–Meinhardt wing-cell focus at λ_c = 1.507 mm — MorphoEval overall 75.8/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 integrates Eq. 3.1–3.2 with Table 1 on a cell one critical wavelength wide. k_c = 6.190, λ_c anchored at 1.507 mm (0.001507 m, Holocene, 0 Ma). Analytical versus numerical dispersion Pearson r = 0.9985 (RMSE 0.0063). One focus at k_p = 0. The radial pigment correlation against the forewing ocellus is 0.26 and is not treated as the wavelength test. Controls are present in the script but are not yet the basis of the score. Overall 75.8/100 (faithfulness 72.4, reproducibility 83.6); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 68f7b12177b4371c73d1b9066a4410ed7696f94a; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 84, Morphological realism / specimen match 68, Parameter expressivity 64, Morphometric validation 70, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 78, Reproducibility package 82. Output judged: docs/media/bicyclus_anynana_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-bicyclus-anynana-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 68f7b12177b4371c73d1b9066a4410ed7696f94a, image/png, 910374 B, 1344×1008 px, artifact_sha256 352dd94d93ec4cc66b8d641ef0e404086a87707ba662ac380b09b7148a54b615 (sha256 352dd94d93ec4cc66b8d641ef0e404086a87707ba662ac380b09b7148a54b615), spec_fingerprint 3f5f93b10ee51771e8149aef602ac80bf975d9d9088f20c810dd83de83f7b77f. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 3f5f93b10ee51771e8149aef602ac80bf975d9d9088f20c810dd83de83f7b77f; artifact_sha256: 352dd94d93ec4cc66b8d641ef0e404086a87707ba662ac380b09b7148a54b615; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/bicyclus_anynana_turing_wavelength_s0/bicyclus_anynana_specimen.jpg=cc4f97c92c75001c..., datasets/bicyclus_anynana_turing_wavelength_s0/bicyclus_anynana_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=b5d0d5a8aa669f84..., datasets/bicyclus_anynana_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=fd0b8adc3491655c...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Eq. 3.1–3.2 and Table 1 of Sekimura et al. 2015: Gierer–Meinhardt kinetics, vein Dirichlet value 2 a1_ss, proximal Dirichlet k_p a1_ss, zero-flux inhibitor. | Low proximal activator selects a focus; high proximal activator suppresses it (their Fig. 4). | Focus number increases with anterior–posterior cell width (their S1 Appendix).; reconstructed_in_script: Explicit finite-difference integration of Eq. 3.1 and the dispersion identity σ(k). | Physical anchor λ_c = 1.507 mm, the scale assigned to this Holocene slot. | Adult GIF composites measured annulus colours onto ocelli whose positions come from specimen segmentation.; transfer_boundary: Table 1 is dimensionless. Mapping λ_dim onto 1.507 mm is this slot's scale anchor, not a length reported in the 2015 paper. | The photograph's leaf and wing-scale texture are the specimen, not a prediction of the wing-cell PDE.; does_not_claim: That the activator radial profile reproduces the black-gold pigment luminance (measured Pearson r = 0.26). | A fossil predecessor or successor species. The chronoseries is the single Holocene terminus. | A cryptographic nanopublication signature. No ~/.nanopub/profile.yml is present.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R1', 'item': 'Score the k_p sweep and the one-wavelength versus two-wavelength focus counts, and keep the non-monotonic k_p = 1 bin visible.'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R2', 'item': 'Score the equal-diffusion ablation: argmax σ(k) must collapse when D2 = D1.'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R3', 'item': 'Segment the specimen photograph (ocelli and the forewing Cu1 pupil) and compare structure-tensor coherency with the GIF. Metrics must not set value equal to reference.'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R4', 'item': 'Report dispersion Pearson r, RMSE, and KS as the wavelength goodness-of-fit, separate from the radial pigment correlation.'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R5', 'item': \"No independent second assessor. This audit is the builder's own score.\"}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R6', 'item': 'No ~/.nanopub/profile.yml, so the nanopublications are not signed. Do not invent a signature.'}" ;
    pk:hasScore 7.58e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

